.TH GO-MCP 7 "2026-04-10" "go-mcp 0.0.9" "Go MCP Framework"
.SH NAME
go-mcp \- zero-dependency Go library for MCP servers and CLI tools
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B go-mcp
.RI ( code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp )
is a zero-dependency Go library for building MCP servers and CLI tools.
It provides two layers: a high-level
.B command
package that generates CLI parsing, MCP registration, plugin manifests,
manpages, and shell completions from a single definition, and low-level
packages for building MCP servers directly.
.SS Which Layer?
Default to
.B command.App
unless you are building a pure MCP server with no CLI surface.
The command layer adds no overhead and generates artifacts for free.
.PP
Use the
.B command
layer when you need CLI subcommands and MCP tools from the same
definitions, or when you want automatic manpages, completions, and
plugin manifests.
.PP
Use the raw
.B server
layer when you need only an MCP server with no CLI surface, or when
you need custom dispatch logic that doesn't fit the command abstraction.
.SH PACKAGES
.TP
.BR go-mcp-command (7)
Unified command abstraction: CLI + MCP + manpages + completions + manifests
from a single definition.
.TP
.BR go-mcp-server (7)
MCP server scaffolding with lifecycle management and provider registries.
.TP
.BR go-mcp-protocol (7)
MCP protocol types and constants (version 2024-11-05).
.TP
.BR go-mcp-output (7)
Context-saving utilities for limiting tool output size (pagination, truncation).
.TP
.BR go-mcp-transport (7)
Transport layer for sending and receiving JSON-RPC messages.
.TP
.BR go-mcp-purse (7)
Plugin manifest and mapping builders for purse-first integration.
.TP
.BR go-mcp-executor (7)
Process management abstraction for MCP servers that manage subprocesses.
.TP
.BR go-mcp-hooks (7)
Per-package PreToolUse hook system for tool interception.
.SH IMPORT PATH
.nf
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp
.fi
.PP
Sub-packages are imported individually:
.nf
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/command
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/server
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/protocol
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/output
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/transport
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/purse
code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/executor
.fi
